<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Your backup codes</h2>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">If you lose your authenticator app, each of these codes lets you in once, in place of an app code. Keep them somewhere safe: they are shown only now, and generating new ones cancels these.</p>

<ul class="mb-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 font-mono text-sm text-gray-900">
  <% @codes.each do |code| %><li><%= code %></li><% end %>
</ul>

<%= link_to "I have saved them, continue", @continue_path, class: "block w-full bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm text-center transition-colors" %>
